 LinkCollectionToPermanentEffect — Effect — Mechtitan Core — MoveCollectionEffect, RecordChosenLinkedExileEffect — MoveCollection's linkToSource files cards it moves under the resolving ability's source, and the cards here are already in exile (a second move would re-fire zone-change triggers and mint new objects); RecordChosenLinkedExile stamps a choice on the source; neither can file a pile under another permanent such as the token the ability just created
 LoyaltyActivationPermission — StaticAbility — The Wandering Emperor — GrantLoyaltyActivationPermissionEffect, EquipAbilitiesAtInstantSpeed — renames and widens the grandfathered ExtraLoyaltyActivation with an instantSpeed axis, mirroring GrantLoyaltyActivationPermissionEffect (no net new type); the effect records a player-wide grant that outlives its source, where this permission must lapse with its source ability, and EquipAbilitiesAtInstantSpeed covers equip, not loyalty abilities
-LoyaltyDamageFloor — ReplacementEffect — Deification — LifeLossFloor, PreventDamagePerCounter — LifeLossFloor floors a player's life total and keys off a LifeLossEvent that never sees a planeswalker; PreventDamagePerCounter spends counters to prevent damage, while this leaves the damage dealt in full and floors only the loyalty it removes
-MarkMustAttackEffect — Effect — Sizzling Soloist — MarkMustAttackThisTurnEffect (renamed into this), MarkMustBlockThisTurnEffect — renames MarkMustAttackThisTurnEffect and gives it a window axis (this turn / its controller's next combat phase), no net new type; the blocking mirror is a floating effect with its own blocker-side semantics and no cross-turn window
