+MarkMustAttackEffect — Effect — Sizzling Soloist — MarkMustAttackThisTurnEffect (renamed into this), MarkMustBlockThisTurnEffect — renames MarkMustAttackThisTurnEffect and gives it a window axis (this turn / its controller's next combat phase), no net new type; the blocking mirror is a floating effect with its own blocker-side semantics and no cross-turn window
 MaxCounters — StaticAbility — Rasputin Dreamweaver — CantReceiveCounters, CapCounterPlacementThisTurn — CantReceiveCounters is an all-kinds group prohibition projected as a flag that cost legality reads, with no kind or number to carry a limit; CapCounterPlacementThisTurn is a replacement that caps one placement then locks the recipient for the turn, blind to the counters already on it
 MeldEffect — Effect — Titania, Voice of Gaea — ExileAndReturnTransformedEffect, ReturnSelfFromZoneTransformedEffect — both move one double-faced object and return it on a face of its own card; meld exiles two separate cards and returns them as one object whose characteristics come from a third definition (the meld result), with a pair check (CR 701.42b/c) neither has an axis for
